/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (This report is published in accordance with the transparency reporting requirements under Articles 15 and 24 of the Digital Services Act \(DSA\), and shares metrics around trust and safety efforts for the time period of January 1, 2025 - December 31, 2025. The report contains data relating to E.U. Member States.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
